    `Art 111(3) the immediate lower instance can examine at least the complaints under Art 95 to 98` `the immediate lower instance of the Federal Supreme Court can examine the complaints under Art 95 to 98`

@export Does the decision I received meet the requirements for a decision that can be appealed: written, with the parties' claims, the reasons, the operative part and a notice of remedies (Art 112(1))?
GIVEN `the decision is subject to appeal to the Federal Supreme Court` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the decision one that can be appealed to the Federal Supreme Court?
      `the decision was notified to the parties in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the decision notified to the parties in writing?
