@export Is my demand for the complete version of the decision in time (Art 112(2), second sentence)?
GIVEN `the decision was notified without reasons under the first sentence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the decision notified promptly and without reasons?
      `the day the decision without reasons was notified` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the decision without reasons notified?
      `the days that rules outside this chapter leave out of the count` IS A NUMBER @desc How many days do the rules on suspension or restoration of time limits leave out of the count? (0 if none.)
      `the day the party demanded the complete version` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the party demand the complete version?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Art 112(2) my demand for the complete version is in time` IS
